      "lines": [
        "例 2　解方程 $x^2-12x+36=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为 $a=1$，$b=-12$，$c=36$，所以"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$D=(-12)^2-4\\times1\\times36=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程有唯一根：　$x=\\frac{12\\pm\\sqrt{0}}{2}=6$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 3　解方程 $7x^2-25x+23=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这里 $a=7$，$b=-25$，$c=23$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "判别式 $D=(-25)^2-4\\times7\\times23=625-644$. 因为判别",
        "式是负的，所以方程没有根."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在 $ax^2+bx+c=0(a\\neq0)$ 这种形式的方程里，系数 $b$ 或 $c$",
        "当中即使有一个等于零，也可以根据二次方程的根的公式求",
        "解. 系数 $b$ 或 $c$ 至少有一个等于零的方程叫做不完全的二次",
        "方程."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例如，$3x^2+17x=0$，$x^2-1.21=0$，$7x^2=0$ 都是不完全",
        "的二次方程. 在第一个方程里，$a=3$，$b=17$，$c=0$，在第",
        "二个方程里，$a=1$，$b=0$，$c=1.21$，在第三个方程里，$a=7$，",
        "$b=0$，$c=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "下面我们利用所推出的公式解不完全的二次方程"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x^2-1.21=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "得到："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$D=0^2-4\\times1\\times(-1.21)=4.84$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x=\\frac{0\\pm\\sqrt{4.84}}{2}$，$x=-1.1$ 或 $x=1.1$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们发现，解 $ax^2+bx=0$ 和 $ax^2+c=0$ 这种形式的不完",
        "全的二次方程时，正象我们在前面做过的一样，利用把方程左"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
